  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Web-Based Natural Dam-Burst Flood Hazard Assessment and ForeCasting SysTem (WeACT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research grant &#x2013; developing novel webbased hazard assessment and forecasting technologies to improve community risk awareness and preparedness for natural damburst floods (NDBFs) in the Sun Koshi basin, Nepal. Benefitting at risk communities in the case study site area, and local/regional stakeholders in disaster risk mitigation. SDGs: 8, 9, 13.</narrative>
  </description>
